                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-preventive",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Preventive Diagnostics Should Be Part of Semi Truck Maintenance",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "preventive"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-preventive-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Many electrical failures develop gradually over time. Including routine inspections and truck electrical diagnostics as part of your regular semi truck maintenance schedule allows technicians to catch problems before they result in expensive roadside breakdowns.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-preventive-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Preventive diagnostics are especially valuable for:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-preventive-3",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Fleet vehicles"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "High-mileage trucks"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Long-haul operations"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Trucks operating in harsh weather"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Vehicles with recurring warning lights"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-preventive-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A proactive maintenance strategy helps maximize uptime while reducing emergency repair costs.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "fig-2",
                  "type": "image",
                  "props": {
                    "width": "full",
                    "image": {
                      "src": "/img/blog/how-electrical-diagnostic-tools-prevent-breakdowns/2.jpg",
                      "width": 1280,
                      "height": 853,
                      "alt": "Sun State International technician performing a wheel service on a semi truck"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-trust",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Trust Sun State International for Commercial Truck Electrical Service",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "trust"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-trust-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If you’ve been searching for commercial truck service near me, choosing a dealership with the right diagnostic equipment and experienced technicians makes all the difference. At Sun State International, our service departments are equipped to diagnose and repair today’s sophisticated commercial truck electrical systems. Whether the issue involves engine electronics, charging systems, sensors, wiring, or onboard computers, our technicians have the tools and training to identify the problem accurately.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-keep-moving",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Keep Small Electrical Problems From Becoming Big Repairs",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "keep-moving"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-keep-moving-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If your truck is displaying warning lights, experiencing electrical issues, or is simply due for routine semi truck maintenance, don’t wait until you’re stranded on the side of the road. Whether you need expert truck electrical diagnostics, replacement electrical components, or an experienced diesel mechanic for semi trucks, Sun State International is here to help. Schedule your service appointment with Sun State International today and let our experienced technicians help keep your trucks on the road and your business moving forward.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
